    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the way",
     "texto": [
      "**怎么走？** is «how do I get there?». **路** is road or street; **路口**, crossing; **地图**, map; **方向**, direction. **过** means to cross or to pass.",
      "**快** is fast and **慢**, slow. **多久** asks how long something lasts."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
